// transcript and on the stream, whose completed frame names the sub-agent by
// the id of its transcript; what the sub-agent was asked goes to the
// transcript of its own. The mock runs no turn of the sub-agent: it records the
// task and nothing of what the sub-agent would do with it.
//
// sr:provides subagent-transcripts/cursor
func (s *session) task(_ context.Context, tu scenario.ToolUse) {
